            "notes": "R1 is for [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb). TOF is the best moneymaking power mercy has for early cash and allows for double procs of [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) and [Distortion](item_5557e2f2-02df-4eac-8128-0c23b71183b1) which we will be taking later.\n\n[First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) can be swapped for [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) but the early regen is great while not having [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1).",
