            "notes": "R3 is where the build starts to shine with [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) giving reduced cooldowns to both the person you're attached to normally and the person on [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb). You can also delay Surge by getting [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) if the enemies are pressuring and eliminating you too much.\n\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is great here because it gives up to 25% [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) which can easily be activated by activating and canceling GA on cooldown and 10% [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) which applies to Surge as well as Mercy's normal cooldowns.\n\nIf you have solid cash from the first two rounds you can go right for [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) or you can again try to stat max for the most heals possible.",
