            "notes": "R4 has a few specific choices for items outside of just aiming for the highest stats. \n\nGrab [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) if you have the cash and are getting to use damage boost enough to get value because the increased stats benefit both normal beam and TOF. \n\n[Caduceus EX](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) is often a good pick on longer maps where mercy can struggle to stay in range of everyone (mostly payload race as teams are often split between each cart).\n\n[Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) is a good item equivelent to [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) while also having CDR. (20% CDR makes [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) faster letting you reduce 6s in cooldowns every 8s)",
